# Standalone Formalized Organic Logic

## A Complete Formal System

---

## 1. Overview

This document presents **Organic Logic** as a **self-contained formal system** that stands independently of GFF-1. The system is:

- **Complete** in syntax, semantics, and proof theory
- **Paraconsistent** (tolerates contradictions without explosion)
- **Generative** (produces new forms from opposition)
- **Self-grounding** (homogenesis as observed ground)
- **Open** (acknowledges its own incompleteness)

---

